      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should call the dentist but they're closed until monday and i'm literally shaking from the pain. i can't wait 2 days. what i mean is, if i took them a bit more frequently throughout the night, like every 3 or 4 hours, would that be safer than just taking a bigger dose all at once? i just need to know how much i can actually take to make this stop.",
